{"id":"661543","name":"姜母鸭","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/661543/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸭肉","amount":"600g"}],"sub":[{"name":"小黄姜","amount":"150g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"小黄姜。","img":"images/661543/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切片备用。","img":"images/661543/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸭肉凉水入锅，放入姜片和料酒焯水。","img":"images/661543/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"撇去浮沫后捞出。","img":"images/661543/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"起锅热油，鸭肉入锅炒。","img":"images/661543/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炒至表面焦黄，铲出备用。","img":"images/661543/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取砂锅，倒入香油。","img":"images/661543/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入姜片翻炒。","img":"images/661543/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"炒至干香。","img":"images/661543/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"把炒好的鸭肉倒入。","img":"images/661543/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入盐、酱油、老抽、米酒和冰糖调味。","img":"images/661543/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"小火煲25分钟。","img":"images/661543/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"水分收干即可。","img":"images/661543/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661543/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"煲的时间不长，鸭肉选嫩一点的鸭子，口感刚好，还带有一定的弹性。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}